27863c6b [gemini-3.8-flash] #between `/home` and system files, keeping maintenance straightforward.
27863c6b [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Swap: The 15.3 GB `zram0` device indicates that compressed in-RAM swap is active, which
27863c6c [gemini-3.8-flash] #reduces wear on the NVMe drives and provides faster paging performance compared to a standard swap
27863c6c [gemini-3.8-flash] #partition or file.
