278672a5 [gemini-3.8-flash] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.2 gemini-3.8-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.003 18.09KB 3.56s
278672a5 [gemini-3.8-flash] #The official Arch Linux `ffmpeg` binary is built without `--enable-decklink` (due to license
278672a5 [gemini-3.8-flash] #incompatibilities between FFmpeg's GPL and Blackmagic's SDK). Because of that, the command exited
