279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #2. Column Layout Calculation:
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Determine the maximum entry name length (plus padding).
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Calculate column count: `Math.max(1, Math.floor(availableWidth / columnWidth))`.
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Lay entries out vertically (standard column-major order like `ls -C`) or horizontally.
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #3. Entry Classification:
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Distinguish directories and files (for example, appending `/` to directory names or tinting
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #with ANSI styling if enabled).
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Sort entries alphabetically, optionally placing directories first.
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279df555 [gemini-3.8-flash] #4. Integration:
