279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.2 gemini-3.8-flash 🌟 🪣 0.7° $0.011 28.53KB 8.50s
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #Several notable entries and differences stand out compared to current stable Godot releases (such
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #as 4.3 / 4.4):
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #1. Expanded Skeleton & Procedural Animation Nodes
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #A substantial suite of new 3D procedural animation and inverse kinematics modifiers is present:
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• IK Solvers & Modifiers: `CCDIK3D`, `ChainIK3D`, `FABRIK3D`, `IterateIK3D`,
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #`JacobianIK3D`, `SplineIK3D`, `TwoBoneIK3D`, `AimModifier3D`, `LookAtModifier3D`,
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #`RetargetModifier3D`, `ConvertTransformModifier3D`, and `CopyTransformModifier3D`.
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Bone Restraints & Utilities: `BoneTwistDisperser3D`, `ModifierBoneTarget3D`,
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #`LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D`, `JointLimitation3D`, and `JointLimitationCone3D`.
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Spring Bone Simulation: A dedicated spring bone suite, including `SpringBoneSimulator3D`
279ef551 [gemini-3.8-flash] #alongside capsule, plane, and sphere collision shapes (`SpringBoneCollision*`).
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #2. OpenXR Spatial & Entity Extensions
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #Extensive OpenXR tracking and spatial anchoring APIs are declared:
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Spatial capability configurations for markers (AprilTag, ArUco, QR code, Micro QR code), planes,
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and anchors.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Fine-grained spatial component containers (`OpenXRSpatialComponent*` for bounds, meshes,
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #parentage, alignment, and persistence).
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Editor integration tools such as `OpenXRInteractionProfileEditor` and
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #`OpenXRBindingModifierEditor`.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #3. Editor & UI Additions
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• `EditorToaster`: Editor toast notification management.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• `FoldableContainer` & `FoldableGroup`: Collapsible container structures.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• `BlitMaterial` & `ColorPalette`: Dedicated resources for blitting and palette management.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Recent 4.3 additions are also represented, including `TileMapLayer` and `StatusIndicator`.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #4. Format & Syntax Notes
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• The file structure uses JSON keys but specifies list elements as raw identifiers rather than
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #quoted strings.
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• There is a syntax mismatch at the `"globals"` field, which opens with `{` but closes with `]`,
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and missing commas between some high-level keys (e.g., after `"variant"`).
279ef552 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
