279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #`ClassDB.get_class_list()` returns every registered class, and `ClassDB.is_parent_class(class_name,
279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #parent_name)` allows you to categorize them into `Node`, `Resource`, or general `Object`.
279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #If you would like a GDScript script to run headlessly and export the JSON file, let me know and I
279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #will be happy to provide it.
279eff4d [gemini-3.8-flash] #
