2848acbf [deepseek-flash] #
2848acbf [deepseek-flash] #So neither example omits it. The only place it doesn't appear is the "Rebindable
2848acbf [deepseek-flash] #alternative" bullet, where I described the change in prose rather than pasting full code. That was
