28b3a021 [gemini-3.8-flash] #Things to consider:
28b3a021 [gemini-3.8-flash] #1. Drive inner tracks: Mechanical platters write faster on the outer tracks (~120–140 MB/s)
28b3a021 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and gradually slow down near the inner tracks (~60–80 MB/s) as the drive fills.
28b3a021 [gemini-3.8-flash] #2. Metadata & Inodes: Because this transfer contains many small files, creating directory
28b3a021 [gemini-3.8-flash] #entries and inodes will periodically drop the average throughput slightly.
