28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #If you are running a graphical environment (such as KDE, GNOME, Sway, or i3) and want a fast
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #command that pops up an image in a minimal frameless viewer:
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #Option A: `feh` (Standard for X11)
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #• `feh`* is a fast, lightweight image viewer controlled via the keyboard.
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Package: `feh`
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Install: `sudo pacman -S feh`
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Usage:
28b3ff7c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
