28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #This way you don't need to rely on BunnyCDN's origin request headers being correct — it'll work no
28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #matter what.
