28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #• My suggestion:* apply `gunzip on;` on your nginx config now (quick, guaranteed fix), and
28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #treat the BunnyCDN setting as optional/secondary — it removes a dependency on CDN behavior that
28bcaeb9 [claude-sonnet-5] #might change or vary per request type.
