28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #Uninstalling Falkon on Arch Linux
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #Basic Removal
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #sudo pacman -R falkon
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #Remove with Unused Dependencies (Recommended)
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #This also cleans up any dependencies that were installed only for Falkon and aren't needed by
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #anything else:
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #sudo pacman -Rs falkon
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #Remove with Config/Cache Files Too
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e33 [claude-sonnet-5] #If you also want to wipe leftover configuration files it may have left behind:
