28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #2. Boot Splash Screen (Plymouth)
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #This is the graphical screen shown during boot, before Plasma even starts — replacing the
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #wall of text output.
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #Arch doesn't include this by default; you have to install and configure Plymouth:
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc9e4a [claude-sonnet-5] #sudo pacman -S plymouth
