28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #- The JPEG is truncated or has malformed data.
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #- It contains an unusual colour profile or metadata.
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Discord’s client failed while reading/uploading the file.
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #- The upload is being altered by a browser extension, proxy, or network issue.
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Less likely: Discord is struggling with the `4096 × 4096` image during preview generation. Its
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #`5.2 MiB` size should normally be acceptable.
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #A clean re-encode often fixes it:
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #
28f21bfd [gpt-5.6-sol] #
