29860685 [deepseek-flash] #Yes — the baker is the only place it can work. `post()` detaches `topo`/`diff`/`ground`, so the dig
29860685 [deepseek-flash] #has exactly one window: after the merge, before `postFlora`. That window is inside the worker.
