2986fbdc [roha]    tile.topoSurface; // already built! tile.tilemesh = layer0.addTileShape(topo, ...); ``` But
2986fbdc [roha]    `tile.topoSurface` was created earlier — either in `TopoTile.onBump` (worker path) or in
2986fbdc [roha]    `GraphicsStack.bakeTileSurface` (no-baker path) — *before* `digOutline` mutated
2986fbdc [roha]    `heightmap.ground`/`heightmap.diff`. So the dig will silently do nothing visible. You need to
