2986fbeb [roha]    Only one change I can see: `FloraPen` in `worker_baker.js` went from `32` to `20`. Everything
2986fbeb [roha]    else is as before. ## On 20 That's now in range, so you've fixed the out-of-bounds uniform
2986fbeb [roha]    read. Index 20 in `RoaPalette` is: ```js G,O,B,A // (0.40, 0.94, 0.70) at alpha 0.52 ``` Mint
2986fbeb [roha]    green, half transparent. Its opaque twin is index 9 (`G,O,B,O`), and a muted opaque green is
2986fbeb [roha]    index 4 (`G,B,G,O`). If transparent is what you want, 20 is fine. ## The dominant cause of
2986fbeb [roha]    darkness is still there `worker_baker.js` `postFlora` still writes zero normals: ```js
2986fbeb [roha]    v.push([mx,my,mz,c, 0,0,0,0]); // ^^^^^^^^^ nx,ny,nz ``` And nothing downstream computes them.
2986fbeb [roha]    `TopoTile.onFlora` just stores the surface: ```js onFlora(verts,indices){
2986fbeb [roha]    this.floraSurface=new Surface(verts,indices,[]); } ``` `addTileShape` calls `addSurface`, not
2986fbeb [roha]    `addFlatSurface`, so it skips the `flatifyVerts → calcNormals` path that `addFlatShape` takes.
2986fbeb [roha]    Result: the tile shader's `dot(normal, sun)` is zero for every flora vertex, so the flora sits
2986fbeb [roha]    at ambient only. Palette index 20's alpha won't save it — it'll still read as a dark mint
2986fbeb [roha]    silhouette. The one-line fix, either side: ```js // wire_topo.js onFlora
2986fbeb [roha]    onFlora(verts,indices){ this.floraSurface=new Surface(verts,indices,[]); const
2986fbeb [roha]    zfactor=4.6/(this.level*8.0); this.floraSurface.calcNormals(zfactor); } ``` Same `zfactor`
2986fbeb [roha]    expression as `onBump`, so shading matches the terrain underneath. Do this first — then you'll
2986fbeb [roha]    actually be judging the palette rather than the missing normals. ## The worker dig hasn't been
2986fbeb [roha]    started For reference, the current state of the three touchpoints: - `worker_baker.js`
2986fbec [roha]    `onmessage` — no `dig` case. - `worker_baker.js` `createTopo` — `postFlora(256,8,FloraPen,22)`
2986fbec [roha]    runs immediately, before any outlines could arrive. - `wire_graphics.js` `buildTile` —
2986fbec [roha]    `buil
