299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #`Bits`, no `digOutline`. Harmless only while `roofOutlines` is empty. The moment a `dig` lands, the
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #worker dies silently.
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #- `// roofOutlines.length=0;` still commented — re-dig if `createTopo` ever ran twice.
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #- `FloraPen=3` is pink, not green. Palette index 3 is `1,G,B,O` = `(1.0, 0.40, 0.70)`
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #opaque. The green you want is index 4 (`G,B,G,O`). But it doesn't matter yet — see next
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #point.
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #- Main-thread flora still broken. `meshTile` calls
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #`TopoFloraSurface(256,8,0,tile.heightmap)` — four args, so `floraMin` is `undefined`
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #(`m.min>undefined` → NaN → false, empty surface), and `c=0` lands in the wrong slot because
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #`TopoFloraSurface` writes the colour at index 3 (`[mx,my,mz,15,...]`), not index 7. So the worker's
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #`FloraPen` is discarded and the visible flora is empty.
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #- `ScratchRes=1024` still clips roof tracing on a 2048 canvas.
