299cc109 [deepseek-flash] #cycle. Keep it anyway: it makes the intent explicit, and it survives someone later adding a third
299cc109 [deepseek-flash] #call site.
299cc109 [deepseek-flash] #
299cc109 [deepseek-flash] #One thing to fix alongside
