29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #Also `DrawSurface(context,surface)` inside the roof2 loop is now commented, so roof surfaces aren't
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #traced into the canvas. They're still concat'd to `surfaces` and uploaded as static mesh — you just
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #lose the scratch overlay.
