29a237d1 [deepseek-flash] #- Main-thread flora is still empty. `TopoFloraSurface(256,8,0,tile.heightmap)` — four args,
29a237d1 [deepseek-flash] #so `floraMin` is `undefined` and `m.min>undefined` is false for every cell. And `c=0` lands in the
29a237d1 [deepseek-flash] #slot where `TopoFloraSurface` writes `15`, so the colour argument does nothing. Either pass a
29a237d1 [deepseek-flash] #`floraMin` and fix the colour slot, or switch to `tile.floraSurface` from the worker.
