29a2f7b8 [deepseek-flash] #Current order, derived from the code:
29a2f7b8 [deepseek-flash] #
29a2f7b8 [deepseek-flash] #What sets it
29a2f7b8 [deepseek-flash] #
29a2f7b8 [deepseek-flash] #`drawLayerList` walks `layer.shapes` in array order. `addShape` pushes. So tile draw order == mesh
29a2f7b8 [deepseek-flash] #order.
29a2f7b9 [deepseek-flash] #
29a2f7b9 [deepseek-flash] #`meshTile` runs from `populateHome(visibleTiles, ...)`, and `visibleTiles` is built in
29a2f7b9 [deepseek-flash] #`refreshTiles`:
29a2f7b9 [deepseek-flash] #
29a2f7b9 [deepseek-flash] #
